			"widgets_values":[
				"This is a photograph of a muscular, dark-skinned man with a short haircut, captured in motion against a vibrant orange background. He is wearing a tight, long-sleeve, gray athletic shirt with a textured pattern. His right fist is clenched and raised, while his left arm is blurred, indicating rapid movement. The lighting creates dramatic shadows, emphasizing his defined muscles and focused expression. The orange background enhances the dynamic energy of the image, giving it a fiery, intense atmosphere. The photograph uses motion blur and high contrast to convey speed and power.",
				"This is a digital artwork in a fantasy style depicting a majestic, mythical phoenix-like bird with vibrant purple and pink feathers, standing with wings spread wide. The bird's eyes are sharp and intense, and it has a golden beak. Its talons are gold with intricate designs. The bird is centered on a glowing, circular magical rune inscribed with mystical symbols, surrounded by a dark, cosmic background filled with swirling colors and sparks. The bird's feathers are detailed with a mix of smooth and feathery textures, and it emits a warm, fiery glow from its lower body. The overall composition is dynamic and magical, with a sense of power and mysticism.",
				"This is a digital drawing in a textured, pop-art style. The central subject is a zebra with human-like features, wearing red and white striped sweater and orange heart-shaped sunglasses. The zebra is singing into a vintage-style microphone, mouth open wide, showing its teeth. The background is a solid, vibrant red with a large, bright orange circle resembling a sun behind the zebra. To the left, there's a small, black silhouette of an acacia tree. The zebra's fur is detailed with black and white stripes, and it has a tuft of dark hair on top of its head. The image has a playful, retro feel.",
				"This is a highly detailed, digital CGI illustration featuring three anthropomorphic animals in a retro, 1970s-style setting. The central figure is a zebra with black and white stripes, wearing large, heart-shaped yellow sunglasses, a yellow and brown striped knitted sweater with a bear patch, and a matching yellow jacket. The zebra holds a microphone in its right hand and has a cheerful expression. To the left, a monkey with brown fur and a small tuft of hair, also in a yellow sweater, holds a large carrot. To the right, a lion with a fluffy mane, wearing similar yellow glasses and sweater, looks excited. The background is a warm, golden-brown gradient, enhancing the retro feel. The textures of the knitted sweaters and fur are highly detailed, adding a tactile quality to the image.",
				"This is a highly detailed, digital CGI photograph of a muscular, dark-skinned man with long, braided hair and a goatee. He has large, realistic, brown angel wings with intricate feather details. He is wearing a black leather jacket adorned with metallic chain accents and an ornate brooch on the left shoulder. His jacket is open, revealing a well-defined, tattooed chest and abs. He is also wearing black pants with a decorative belt. The man has a serious expression and is looking downward, with his hands resting on the belt. The background is dark and blurred, with a soft, warm light source to the left.",
				"This is a highly detailed digital artwork of a young girl with fair skin and curly blonde hair, wearing a medieval-style, long, green and brown, embroidered tunic over a beige dress. She holds two glass bottles; one with green liquid in her left hand and the other with amber liquid in her right hand, both with cork stoppers. She also wears a brown leather belt with a small pouch and several straps. Her expression is neutral, and she stands against a textured, light gray background. The art style is realistic with a fantasy medieval theme, showcasing intricate details in the clothing and textures of the bottles and background.",
				"This is a highly detailed, digital CGI artwork depicting a close-up of a pug dog's face. The pug has a serious expression, with fur texture rendered in realistic detail. The dog's head is adorned with an elaborate, ornate headdress made of turquoise and silver gemstones, featuring large blue orbs and intricate patterns. The background transitions from a starry, cosmic sky at the top to a reddish-orange sunset at the bottom, creating a surreal, otherworldly atmosphere. The pug's fur is predominantly white with gray and black accents, and its eyes are a striking orange. The overall style blends realism with fantasy elements, creating a unique and captivating visual."
			],
