			"widgets_values":[
				"This is a highly detailed, black-and-white digital drawing of a winged warrior riding a galloping horse. The warrior, with flowing hair and a halo, wields a long sword raised above his head. His muscular build is accentuated by a detailed, armored tunic and boots. The horse, adorned with intricate harnesses, has a powerful, dynamic stance with its mane and tail flowing. The wings of the warrior are expansive, with finely textured feathers. The background is completely black, making the monochromatic, grayscale figures stand out starkly. The drawing has a realistic yet slightly stylized, dramatic effect, emphasizing the heroic and mythical nature of the subject.",
				"This is a digital drawing in a textured, pop-art style. It features a zebra with anthropomorphic qualities, singing into a vintage-style microphone. The zebra wears orange heart-shaped sunglasses and a red-and-white striped sweater. Its mouth is open wide, suggesting it's mid-song. The background is a solid, bright red with a large, orange circular sun-like shape behind the zebra. To the left, there is a small, stylized African acacia tree. The zebra's black-and-white stripes are detailed and prominent. The overall composition is vibrant and playful, with a strong contrast between the red background and the zebra's striped pattern."
